-          <p>
-            I'm a <strong>Computer and Communication Engineering graduate</strong> from <strong>Abubakar Tafawa Balewa University</strong> who took a detour into YouTube — and didn't look back. While still in school, I helped grow a channel from 0 to 50K+ subscribers. Which sounds like a win. And it was. But the thing that took the longest to crack wasn't the content, the editing, or the algorithm.
